sentences.text:
Let the applicant- Bharatvir be released on bail in the aforesaid case on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties in the like amount to the satisfaction of the court concerned subject to following conditions:-
1. The applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence by intimidating/
pressurizing the witnesses, during the investigation or trial;
2. The applicant shall cooperate in the trial sincerely without seeking any adjournment;
Bharatvir vs State Of U.P Through Its Principal ... on 22 March, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/146472905/
2 3.

